  <article class="prose-dolphin max-w-none">

    <p>
      The DMPX-042 is a Dolphin-engineered turnkey module class supplied with a remanufactured Alfa Laval MOPX 209, MOPX 210, WHPX 409, or WHPX 510 centrifuge. These are distinct base machines, so every capacity remains attached to the selected machine and fluid. Dolphin is an independent remanufacturer and is not affiliated with or authorized by Alfa Laval.
    </p>

